}

## ---- operator application ----

## Apply desired-count too-many.
## More than 6 desireds is an error
sp {agent-world*apply*desired-count*too-many
   :default
   (state <s> ^desireds <desireds>)
   (<desireds> ^desired-count { > 6 <n> })
-->
   (write (crlf) |ERROR: desireds | <desireds> | has desired-count | <n> |; agent-world counts at most 6 desireds.|)
   (interrupt)
}
